# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Anything starting with VITE_ is bundled into the browser build,
# so the key is visible to visitors of a deployed site; rotate it regularly (see docs/functional-requirements.md §22.4).
# Used from Phase 9 (AI concierge). Without a key the concierge falls back to a scripted mock.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
